ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/202603170331566527_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/202603170331566527_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/match1713670date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">让二追二！狼队2-2客平小蜜蜂联赛三轮不败 伊戈尔·蒂亚戈破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260317/zhanbao_image_1713670_1773697676_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260317/zhanbao_image_1713670_1773697676_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260317/zhanbao_image_1713670_1773697676_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>伊戈尔·蒂亚戈破门，布伦特福德2-2狼队。积分榜方面，布伦特福德45分第七，狼队联赛两连胜终结17分仍垫底。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b826c53ed39native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">后7名全踢平！英超积分榜：狼队连续3轮拿分，小蜜蜂距第6蓝军3分</a></p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b84149cb32dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴西友谊赛名单：内马尔、安东尼无缘，维尼修斯、恩德里克入选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/202603170255091800_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/202603170255091800_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/202603170255091800_720.jpg"> </div><p>巴西公布新一期友谊赛名单，内马尔、安东尼、里沙利松落选，维尼修斯、拉菲尼亚、卡塞米罗、恩德里克入选。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b85376cee9anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">安帅：若内马尔在世界杯身体状态达到100%，他就能入选世界杯阵容</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b8392018afanative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">蹬踏对手染红！官方：杰克逊因暴力行为被禁赛2场</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260314/202603142316376912.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260314/202603142316376912.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260314/202603142316376912.jpg"> </div><p>德国足协官方消息，杰克逊将因暴力行为被禁赛2场。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-16/69b810740b535native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">刚续约6年！TA：里斯·詹姆斯近5年第10次腿筋受伤，将伤缺数周</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.09" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/202603162222598539.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.09" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.09" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/202603162222598539_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/202603162222598539_720.jpg"> </div><p>据The Athletic最新消息，切尔西队长里斯·詹姆斯遭遇5年多来第10次腿筋伤病，预计将伤缺数周。</p><p><strong>【其它新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b83d1206701native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">对红军表现出色！泰晤士：图多尔将再执教热刺2场 若输球可能下课</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.59" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/69b83d70ed1ff_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/69b83d70ed1ff_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260317/69b83d70ed1ff_720.jpg"> </div><p>据《泰晤士》报道，因对利物浦时带队表现出色，图多尔将至少再执教热刺2场比赛。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b857052dea0native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">努力终有回响！恩德里克加盟里昂12场6球4助 时隔1年再进巴西名单</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260112/6964c7cba2810.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260112/6964c7cba2810.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260112/6964c7cba2810.jpg"> </div><p>恩德里克时隔1年再进巴西队名单，上一次能够进入名单还是作为内马尔的替补被<a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2025-03-15/67d49d72d0394native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">临时征召</a>。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-16/69b82517cbe3enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">差点加盟巴萨！23岁尼科身价跌剩5000万欧，毕巴2000万顶薪续10年</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260216/6993278a1e747.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260216/6993278a1e747.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260216/6993278a1e747.jpg"> </div><p>德转今日更新西甲身价，毕巴边锋尼科·威廉姆斯身价再次下跌1000万欧，现身价剩5000万欧。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-16/69b822234c933native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">身价5连跌+遭遇重伤！25岁罗德里戈身价跌至5000万 巅峰高达1.1亿</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260303/69a6fed15bbb9.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260303/69a6fed15bbb9.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260303/69a6fed15bbb9.jpg"> </div><p>今日德转更新西甲球员身价，皇马前锋罗德里戈身价再次下跌，目前已经跌至5000万欧元。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b82f5177ce8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">真要走？意媒：米兰不满莱奥的表现和态度，已推迟和他的续约谈判</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260103/6958400290b54.jpg"> </div><p>全市场报道，米兰已经推迟和前锋莱奥的续约谈判。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b832af9e842native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">胖虎要走！太阳报：曼联想签两中场应对卡塞米罗离队 正关注中卫</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.33" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/69b7d7d6053b6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/69b7d7d6053b6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260316/69b7d7d6053b6.jpg"> </div><p>据《太阳报》报道，曼联希望签下两名中场球员，以应对卡塞米罗即将离队的影响。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b8341dc3a64native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">TA：皇马高层对阿韦洛亚表达了支持，相信本赛季能赢得奖杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260118/696cd0ae652f5.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260118/696cd0ae652f5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260118/696cd0ae652f5.jpg"> </div><p>TA报道，皇马高层对阿韦洛亚和其团队表达了支持，重申俱乐部高层相信球队有能力在本赛季赢得奖杯。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b83452b1a86native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧冠各队本轮染黄将停赛球员：维尼修斯、范戴克、亚马尔在列</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.43" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_191122/5dd789296b5bd.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.43" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.43" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_191122/5dd789296b5bd.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_191122/5dd789296b5bd.jpg"> </div><p>欧足联官网统计了在次回合比赛染黄，若球队晋级，下一场将停赛的球员。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b8396a3ede9native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">见不到名场面了！邮报：切尔西将取消在中圈围圈，改移至己方半场</a></p><p>《每日邮报》体育版获悉，切尔西内部认定开球前的中圈围圈仪式已变得过于分散注意力，俱乐部即将叫停这一做法。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-17/69b855b7d8103native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">倒霉！内马尔再次落选巴西名单，此前安帅现场考察时他轮休缺战</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251123/69228e2c4efcc.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 10